# Keyboard settings (0.0.5h): the German layout swaps Y and Z; Caps Lock
# shows a CAPS pill on the taskbar and capitalises; the repeat rate can be
# changed. Settings window at 290,92 (700x560); the Keyboard tab is the
# 5th sidebar entry; its Layout card's third chip is "German".
gui: desktop up at 1280x800
cerberus kernel shell
!mouseto 150 780
!button left down
!button left up
!wait 0.4
!key set
!wait 0.8
!mouseto 370 313
!button left down
!button left up
!wait 0.4
